## MVC

MVC = Model-View_Controller
Model - database define
View- route define
Controller - define functionality

## VS Code extension for check server

Thunder Client(working as POSTMAN)

## POST Method

Body - JSON
query - URL
param - dynamic value

## For Use ENV File

1. Install this : npm i dotenv

2. Add this to index : require("dotenv").config()

console.log(process.env.variable_name);
